  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\"><b>과학수업 만들기&gt;</b>의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의&nbsp;<b>'협업'</b>을 위해<b>&nbsp;공유</b>되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</u></span></b></span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px dashed rgb(121, 165, 228); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(219, 232, 251);\"><p><b style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">#온라인수업 #동아리 #영화</span></b></p></div><p><br></p></div><p><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">정말 실시간쌍방향수업 보통일은 아닌것 같습니다. ^^</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">수업준비가 하루살이 인생을 연상케하네요. ㅎㅎㅎㅎ</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">연이은 태풍상륙에</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;하루가 멀다하고 재난예보 문자가 왔는데요</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">재난중 태풍과 관련된 동아리 수업 편성했습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">학생들이 제출한 감기관련 학습지를 보고 오늘은 얼마나 뿌듯하고 큰 감동이던지....</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">우리학교는 동아리, 스포츠, 예술체육은 컨텐츠수업이라 마음은 여유가 있습니다.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&lt;영화제목 : 인투더 스톰&gt;</span></strong></span></p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1. 2000</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">년대 대한민국 삼켰던 역대급 태풍들 영상보기</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-layout-grid-mode: both; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">영화 요약영상보기</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-layout-grid-mode: both; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-layout-grid-mode: both; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\">수중 토네이도 발생기 만들기 실험 영상보기</span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-layout-grid-mode: both; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">4. 온라인 학습지 작성 후 제출</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-layout-grid-mode: both; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p><p><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-layout-grid-mode: both; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">★ 오픈채팅방 열어서 실시간 피드백을 하니 학생들이 더 잘하는 것 같아요 ^^</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-layout-grid-mode: both; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">★&nbsp;온라인 학습지 파일 탑재해요 (<strong>저같이 이해력 떨어진 사람도 알아볼 수 있어요</strong>..)</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-layout-grid-mode: both; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 가입, 만들기, 학생에게 보내기, 받은 학습지 보고 저장하기, 간단한 명령어 포함</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-layout-grid-mode: both; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">★&nbsp;온라인 학습지&nbsp;예시(링크포함)</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-layout-grid-mode: both; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.liveworksheets.com/c?a=s&amp;g=3-3&amp;s=%EB%8F%99%EC%95%84%EB%A6%AC3%EC%B0%A8&amp;t=bshed6vrnf&amp;l=so&amp;i=uuxnncs&amp;r=dk\">https://www.liveworksheets.com/c?a=s&amp;g=3-3&amp;s=%EB%8F%99%EC%95%84%EB%A6%AC3%EC%B0%A8&amp;t=bshed6vrnf&amp;l=so&amp;i=uuxnncs&amp;r=dk</a>&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-layout-grid-mode: both; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-